  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "不眠手记 v1.5.6：夜间模式和顶栏修复、统一样式加载、轻量存储和受限 GitHub 转发",
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "node scripts/build-css.mjs && node scripts/dev-server.mjs",
